# Source and test code
# NOTE: leading slash anchors to bundle root. Without it, `src/` (gitignore
# semantics) also matches `dist/ui/src/...`, which would strip the bundled MCP
# App UI HTML (dist/ui/src/apps/ui/mcp-app.html) and break the storage UI in
# Claude Desktop. Keep these anchored.
/src/
/test/

